  "prefLabel": "Env-A 603.02 Permit-by-Notification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 603.02 Permit-by-Notification.\n\n(a) A non-metallic mineral processing plant as defined in Env-A 2802, that is not a major source shall be eligible to be installed or operated pursuant to a permit-by-notification.\n\n(b) To install or operate a non-metallic mineral processing plant pursuant to a permit-by-notification, the owner or operator shall comply with Env-A 2806.\n\nSource. #9791, eff 10-1-10; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a600.html"
